{#
  chat/focus-exit.njk — the way out of focus view.

  It lives at page level, not inside the stage, and it is fixed to the bottom
  margin that focus view reserves. That margin is why it exists: the video
  stops short of the viewport bottom so this button and YouTube's own control
  bar are both reachable, neither covering the other.

  Hidden unless <html> carries .chat-focus.
#}
<button class="chat-focus-exit" type="button" data-chat="focus-exit">Show status &amp; transcript</button>
